artifacts/multi-catfish-c3-astra-pro-review-20260905-r1/CROSS-MODEL-STATE.md:7:Fable reconstructed the simulator causal chain before opening C3 history and concluded `REDESIGN_R3_TARGET`. It correctly identified stale energy pricing, privileged exact physics, weak learned-Q3 evidence, and joint beam consolidation. Its proposed cost-share exactness claim was rejected by the controller because equal shares sum to network power within one configuration but separately evaluated unilateral share differences need not sum to the simultaneously executed joint difference. See `evidence/01-fable-c3-source-audit.md` and `evidence/08-root-fable-adjudication.md`.
