This sample is slower than the median profiling estimate, so I’m capping only my evidence-collection patience, not adding a runtime deadline to the algorithm. If it does not complete shortly, I’ll retain the synthetic agreement proof and report the real-anchor agreement check as incomplete rather than imply equality.
